      },
      "message": "feat(post): Fanuc AI contour control option (G05.1 Q1 R / Q0)\n\nThe Fanuc post has a new off-by-default option, aiContourControl, and\na level option, aiContourLevel (1-10, default 5). With it on, each\noperation writes G05.1 Q1 R<level> after its preamble and G05.1 Q0 at\nits end. A canned cycle writes Q0 before the cycle block. A probe\nsection with the spindle stopped does not arm it. A level outside 1-10\nis refused by name. The default output does not change.\n\nRefs #2603\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
